y of your answers thus far. ","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"You may use this space to explain or elaborate on any of your answers thus far.&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q2f","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ML","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","InputWidth":595,"InputHeight":141},"QuestionDescription":"You may use this space to explain or elaborate on any of your answers thus far. ","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID111"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3ej1HpRwjR63YKa","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID112","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q2t","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID112"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3ej1HpRwjR63YKa","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID113","SecondaryAttribute":"Below are additional notes Group 2 made in their lab book. You will then be asked about their dat...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: &quot;Qualtrics Grotesque&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal;\">Below are additional notes Group 2 made in their lab book. You will then be asked about their data and methods. Click <a href=\"https:\/\/cornell.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_cVnx10pGM7eFWZL\">here<\/a> to see the intro again, <a href=\"https:\/\/stanforduniversity.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_6niQ1OxSRh2yzfn\" onclick=\"\">here<\/a> to see Group 1&#39;s lab book, and <a href=\"https:\/\/corn